00:02:01.082 --> 00:02:02.548
You're young, don't look.

00:02:03.191 --> 00:02:03.778
Stop it.

00:02:08.143 --> 00:02:09.210
She...

00:02:09.349 --> 00:02:11.755
Did she shed her skin like a snake?

00:02:13.518 --> 00:02:14.705
It's really that creature.

00:02:15.884 --> 00:02:16.991
What is it?

00:02:18.373 --> 00:02:20.168
It isn't a ghost.
It's a person.

00:02:20.669 --> 00:02:21.642
I'll explain it to you later.

00:02:22.258 --> 00:02:25.092
If I'm not mistaken, the woman
is going to murder someone.

00:02:26.189 --> 00:02:27.843
It's never too old to learn.

00:02:27.909 --> 00:02:29.859
There are just so many strange
and unique things in this world.

00:02:30.389 --> 00:02:31.535
Is she going to murder her husband?

00:02:34.175 --> 00:02:34.788
She's gone.

00:02:36.732 --> 00:02:37.732
What's gone?

00:02:38.910 --> 00:02:39.630
That woman.

00:02:42.223 --> 00:02:43.661
Let's go.
You, go after her.

00:02:44.012 --> 00:02:45.052
Me?

00:02:50.561 --> 00:02:54.122
From what I know, this creature likes
to drink the blood of young women.

00:02:54.419 --> 00:02:55.913
It will be more interested...

00:02:56.176 --> 00:02:57.163
in a mage.

00:02:57.992 --> 00:02:59.152
I'll guard that child.

00:02:59.477 --> 00:03:01.464
Go and find the woman
in the neighbourhood.

00:03:02.843 --> 00:03:03.542
Okay.

00:03:26.346 --> 00:03:29.332
He descends according to different
size of shadows of the buildings.

00:03:29.874 --> 00:03:30.887
It's Shadow Magic.

00:03:32.725 --> 00:03:34.019
-No.
-It's fine.

00:03:34.086 --> 00:03:35.177
Just one kiss.

00:03:35.535 --> 00:03:36.951
-What if someone shows up?
-It's fine.

00:03:37.174 --> 00:03:39.286
Ling Ling, she isn't in the forest.

00:03:40.630 --> 00:03:42.017
Go to ask the property management office ...

00:03:42.252 --> 00:03:43.243
who are under 20 years old,

00:03:43.302 --> 00:03:45.454
and also a mage.

00:03:46.015 --> 00:03:46.663
Okay.

00:03:47.705 --> 00:03:48.922
Go on.

00:03:52.280 --> 00:03:54.762
I've asked about it. About seventy
households fit your requirements.

00:03:55.084 --> 00:03:57.105
But, only six of them...

00:03:57.106 --> 00:03:58.106
registered themselves as mages.

00:04:00.362 --> 00:04:02.189
Which house is nearest
to that woman's house?

00:04:02.629 --> 00:04:04.770
The nearest one is to rent
by three girls.

00:04:04.870 --> 00:04:05.901
I'm heading there now.

00:04:06.260 --> 00:04:08.264
Be quick. Find her as soon as possible.

00:04:08.337 --> 00:04:09.484
Or else, someone will die!

00:04:18.628 --> 00:04:19.562
Why are you here?

00:04:20.392 --> 00:04:21.459
Did anything happen to you?

00:04:24.173 --> 00:04:26.656
What are you talking about?
Do you want something to happen to us?

00:04:27.691 --> 00:04:28.686
She is not here?

00:04:28.687 --> 00:04:30.179
Did I get it wrong?

00:04:30.525 --> 00:04:32.407
-Talk to me!
-I'm sorry.

00:04:32.522 --> 00:04:34.435
I got the wrong unit. I have
something important to do...

00:04:37.224 --> 00:04:37.944
Nannan!

00:04:39.383 --> 00:04:41.150
Don't go. She's a mage.

00:04:41.194 --> 00:04:42.123
She can hold on.

00:04:43.675 --> 00:04:45.504
-What talent are you?
-Light.

00:04:45.824 --> 00:04:46.913
Light Talent.

00:04:48.353 --> 00:04:49.226
Follow me.

00:04:52.750 --> 00:04:54.221
Is there a monster here?

00:04:55.626 --> 00:04:56.386
Keep quiet.

00:05:09.362 --> 00:05:11.328
Finally I caught you, monster.

00:05:11.826 --> 00:05:12.726
Fiery Fist!

00:05:14.879 --> 00:05:15.688
You...

00:05:19.403 --> 00:05:20.243
Don't run!

00:05:34.768 --> 00:05:36.274
Oh dear, the lights are all on.

00:05:36.584 --> 00:05:38.643
I can't use my Shadow Magic
without any dark areas.

00:05:42.003 --> 00:05:43.973
Fan Mo, there's a situation.

00:05:44.602 --> 00:05:45.495
What's wrong?

00:05:46.068 --> 00:05:48.291
That woman's husband, he...

00:05:48.664 --> 00:05:49.503
He's also shedding his skin.

00:05:50.699 --> 00:05:52.000
Ling Ling, what's going on?

00:05:52.001 --> 00:05:53.223
Both of them are acting strange?

00:05:54.922 --> 00:05:56.068
Did you capture that female monster?

00:05:56.491 --> 00:05:58.539
She escaped.
What's going on now?

00:05:58.663 --> 00:06:00.423
There are three girls waiting
for me to rescue them.

00:06:02.660 --> 00:06:05.153
Don't worry, they will be safe for now.

00:06:05.247 --> 00:06:06.381
How do you know that?

00:06:07.121 --> 00:06:08.612
Stop asking questions. Quick.

00:06:08.702 --> 00:06:10.129
Now, we have to save the child.

00:06:16.895 --> 00:06:18.768
Crying, you only know crying.

00:06:18.855 --> 00:06:20.381
What annoys me the most...

00:06:20.382 --> 00:06:22.645
is your cries.

00:06:25.660 --> 00:06:26.780
Fan Mo, quick.

00:06:27.093 --> 00:06:28.827
He hasn't finished shedding yet.

00:06:28.867 --> 00:06:31.127
Once he has shed his skin,
the child will definitely die.

00:06:31.961 --> 00:06:33.333
Shadow Shift.

00:06:44.065 --> 00:06:45.692
From now on,

00:06:45.880 --> 00:06:47.442
I won't have to...

00:06:47.536 --> 00:06:51.487
listen to your cries anymore.

00:06:51.627 --> 00:06:54.193
Oh no! Roaring Thunder!

00:07:01.060 --> 00:07:02.340
He wasn't paralysed at all.

00:07:02.708 --> 00:07:04.468
Meddlesome thing!

00:07:06.813 --> 00:07:09.937
Show yourself!

00:07:12.574 --> 00:07:14.465
Fan Mo, the male monster
is extremely strong.

00:07:14.490 --> 00:07:15.350
Be careful.

00:07:17.661 --> 00:07:20.839
Monster, today, I'm going to kill you.

00:07:22.967 --> 00:07:23.661
What?

00:07:26.563 --> 00:07:28.789
No, you're joining hands?

00:07:30.493 --> 00:07:32.859
It's hard to defeat both of them.
I'm coming to save you.

00:07:32.881 --> 00:07:33.958
Don't worry about me.

00:07:34.486 --> 00:07:35.819
I can't use Shadow Magic.

00:07:37.632 --> 00:07:38.486
Okay then.

00:07:39.074 --> 00:07:40.753
Boots of the Beast!

00:07:47.679 --> 00:07:48.772
You have a pair of Boots of the Beast?

00:07:49.873 --> 00:07:52.043
Great, leave with the child.

00:07:52.256 --> 00:07:54.034
Don't fight recklessly as
you'll hurt innocent people.

00:08:13.358 --> 00:08:15.020
Mum, I'm going back
to my room to revise.

00:08:15.395 --> 00:08:16.647
Switch on the lights...

00:08:16.648 --> 00:08:17.891
in case your eyes get hurt.

00:08:19.933 --> 00:08:21.366
Why are you revising now?

00:08:21.403 --> 00:08:23.043
You nearly killed me.

00:08:28.305 --> 00:08:29.912
As I'm afraid of hurting
innocent people in the building,

00:08:29.913 --> 00:08:32.410
I can't use magic in the house.

00:08:32.713 --> 00:08:35.767
But, since you are coming after me,
don't blame me for acting viciously.

00:08:40.481 --> 00:08:42.611
Fuchsia, Fiery Fist, Heavenly Fire!

00:08:59.046 --> 00:09:00.313
Fan Mo, are you okay?

00:09:01.341 --> 00:09:03.461
-Is the child okay?
-We're okay.

00:09:04.134 --> 00:09:06.080
I have to check on the three girls.

00:09:06.760 --> 00:09:08.803
Go to the rooftop. My Fiery Fist...

00:09:08.804 --> 00:09:10.710
is at least double that
of the normal Level 2 magic.

00:09:11.532 --> 00:09:14.092
The two monsters were
hit by my Fiery Fist.

00:09:14.276 --> 00:09:15.981
Even if they didn't die,
they would be handicapped.

00:09:17.320 --> 00:09:19.280
I didn't expect you to be this capable.

00:09:22.129 --> 00:09:24.415
Why am I delighted for being
praised by a primary school student?

00:09:37.169 --> 00:09:38.009
Where is the female monster?

00:09:38.712 --> 00:09:41.645
She probably used the male monster
to protect herself...

00:09:41.871 --> 00:09:42.937
and didn't get hurt.

00:09:42.996 --> 00:09:45.580
-Then, she escaped.
-How cunning.

00:09:46.716 --> 00:09:48.010
Are the three girls okay?

00:09:49.956 --> 00:09:52.805
They weren't in their house.
One of the girls wasn't hurt.

00:09:52.952 --> 00:09:54.588
She probably took the other two to the hospital.

00:09:56.743 --> 00:09:57.609
What about this one?

00:09:58.531 --> 00:09:59.304
Is he dead?

00:10:00.056 --> 00:10:03.086
Is he a person or a monster?

00:10:03.549 --> 00:10:05.865
It's a Scaly Beast.
It drinks human blood.

00:10:05.866 --> 00:10:07.369
Then, it will live on them
like a parasite.

00:10:08.313 --> 00:10:11.165
As long as we kill it in a short time,
it will shed its skin again.

00:10:11.699 --> 00:10:14.632
Then, the host may recover and be saved.

00:10:15.670 --> 00:10:17.030
Then, hurry up and
find the female monster...

00:10:17.083 --> 00:10:18.185
and save that woman.

00:10:19.039 --> 00:10:21.214
No, we've cleared our task.

00:10:21.606 --> 00:10:23.926
The City Hunters
can take care of the rest.

00:10:25.945 --> 00:10:28.235
Save me...

00:10:29.144 --> 00:10:31.664
Call the ambulance.
He's a human being. Don't let him die.

00:10:33.291 --> 00:10:34.911
Little girl, are you sure?

00:10:34.992 --> 00:10:36.366
He won't become a monster again?

00:10:37.578 --> 00:10:38.924
He's our client.

00:10:39.173 --> 00:10:41.499
If he dies, we'll lose
the remaining 200,000 yuan.

00:10:41.966 --> 00:10:43.193
Yes...

00:10:45.321 --> 00:10:46.320
120.

00:10:46.399 --> 00:10:47.780
Someone got hurt.

00:10:55.627 --> 00:10:56.626
You're awake?

00:10:57.994 --> 00:10:58.715
You slept for a long time.

00:11:01.299 --> 00:11:03.952
It's noon. I came back late last night.

00:11:06.612 --> 00:11:10.012
Friend, you slept for two days.

00:11:12.674 --> 00:11:15.265
What did you do that night?
Why were you so exhausted?

00:11:17.329 --> 00:11:18.209
Don't mention it.

00:11:27.037 --> 00:11:28.663
Where did that female monster escape to?

00:11:29.290 --> 00:11:30.820
Should I ignore it?

00:11:33.451 --> 00:11:36.104
Looks like the monsters
in this big city are unavoidable.

00:11:36.518 --> 00:11:38.446
I have to increase my strength quickly.

00:11:39.593 --> 00:11:42.863
I wasted a few days. From now on,
I have to settle down and practice .

00:12:02.992 --> 00:12:06.298
I remember, when the Fire Magic and Thunder Magic
was about to reach Level 2,

00:12:06.338 --> 00:12:09.357
such situation appeared beside the Stardust as well..

00:12:11.707 --> 00:12:14.031
Great, I'll reach Level 2 tonight.

00:12:21.534 --> 00:12:23.371
Catfish,  I count on you now.

00:12:35.233 --> 00:12:37.360
Come on, let's break through.

00:12:59.606 --> 00:13:01.312
Exploding Fire, Fiery Fist,

00:13:01.404 --> 00:13:03.002
Roaring Thunder, Lightning Bolt,

00:13:03.002 --> 00:13:04.662
Shadow Shift, Shadow Spike,

00:13:04.715 --> 00:13:05.830
Dimensional Summoning.

00:13:06.235 --> 00:13:08.960
I have seven talents now.
Who can stop me now?

00:13:23.146 --> 00:13:25.444
Mo Fan, I finally found you.

00:13:25.599 --> 00:13:26.786
We're about to call a police.

00:13:27.985 --> 00:13:30.545
Why? I was practising
behind closed doors.

00:13:33.271 --> 00:13:35.325
You come and go like a shadow.
I didn't know about that.

00:13:36.672 --> 00:13:40.128
By the way,
there's a girl looking for you.

00:13:41.064 --> 00:13:44.034
A girl? Is she pretty?Sexy?

00:13:44.608 --> 00:13:46.669
An underage girl.

00:13:47.714 --> 00:13:48.367
Ling Ling?

00:13:54.571 --> 00:13:57.197
There's a concert in our gym tonight.

00:13:57.291 --> 00:13:58.505
I have two tickets.

00:13:59.172 --> 00:14:01.371
I can't go as I have another date.
Do you want it?

00:14:02.202 --> 00:14:03.295
Get lost!

00:14:20.867 --> 00:14:21.721
Here are your drinks.

00:14:39.788 --> 00:14:41.297
Really?

00:14:41.447 --> 00:14:43.167
As long as we rescue that woman,

00:14:43.168 --> 00:14:45.311
her husband will pay us 1 million yuan?

00:14:47.221 --> 00:14:48.234
It's not a reward.

00:14:48.394 --> 00:14:49.492
It's a commission,

00:14:49.917 --> 00:14:51.303
an advanced payment.

00:14:51.782 --> 00:14:53.616
Then, find it quickly.
I'll capture it.

00:14:54.050 --> 00:14:55.676
No, I'll save her.

00:14:59.836 --> 00:15:01.009
Strawberry milkshake?

00:15:01.375 --> 00:15:02.522
Do you think I'm a child?

00:15:04.253 --> 00:15:06.294
Okay, Master Hunter...

00:15:15.710 --> 00:15:16.297
Look.

00:15:18.164 --> 00:15:18.830
Map?

00:15:19.182 --> 00:15:21.435
Don't tell me you installed
CCTVs around the city?

00:15:22.477 --> 00:15:23.837
I don't need to do that.

00:15:24.771 --> 00:15:26.361
This isn't a normal map.

00:15:27.121 --> 00:15:29.161
If I enter the female
monster's blood data,

00:15:29.547 --> 00:15:32.257
her location will be shown here.

00:15:35.005 --> 00:15:36.072
You're really good.

00:15:36.192 --> 00:15:37.992
You created this high-tech tracker.

00:15:40.232 --> 00:15:42.352
Later, the location shown
with a red dot...

00:15:42.538 --> 00:15:44.087
will be the woman's location.

00:15:44.903 --> 00:15:45.876
Why isn't it appearing yet?

00:15:46.956 --> 00:15:48.835
The sun is setting. Wait a bit.

00:15:50.049 --> 00:15:53.168
This Parasitic Monster looks just like
a normal human being in the day.

00:15:53.629 --> 00:15:57.654
At night, when the monster
needs nutrients, it will hunt for it.

00:16:02.487 --> 00:16:03.487
This is delicious!

00:16:04.218 --> 00:16:05.644
She's still young.

00:16:08.187 --> 00:16:09.281
What is this black dot?

00:16:10.134 --> 00:16:11.535
That is our location.

00:16:14.579 --> 00:16:15.419
The red dot appeared!

00:16:17.698 --> 00:16:18.762
What's wrong?

00:16:19.287 --> 00:16:19.913
What's wrong?

00:16:21.147 --> 00:16:23.453
Ling Ling, something wrong with your tracker ?

00:16:23.759 --> 00:16:25.635
Didn't you say we're tracking
the female Scaly Beast?

00:16:26.067 --> 00:16:27.707
Why are there so many red dots?

00:16:28.334 --> 00:16:30.778
Don't tell me that the female
Scaly Beast can be everywhere?

00:16:31.099 --> 00:16:32.314
Impossible.

00:16:32.902 --> 00:16:35.115
My tracker won't be wrong.

00:16:35.458 --> 00:16:37.870
Then, what's going on?
Look at the red dots.

00:16:38.070 --> 00:16:39.724
There are so many of them.

00:16:43.342 --> 00:16:45.305
Quick, tell me.

00:16:45.345 --> 00:16:47.312
Will the Parasitic Monster
spread like a disease?

00:16:56.254 --> 00:17:00.058
♪ Until we start to fight keep alive ♪

00:17:00.059 --> 00:17:03.286
♪ No matter what they said
you must believe in yourself ♪

00:17:03.312 --> 00:17:06.290
♪ You will breaking through the night ♪

00:17:06.303 --> 00:17:08.880
♪ Fire in your eyes shining so bright ♪

00:17:13.553 --> 00:17:15.808
♪ Every lonely journey I begin ♪

00:17:15.809 --> 00:17:17.869
♪ Is another mystery
this life gives me ♪

00:17:17.908 --> 00:17:20.023
♪ I can't escape my fate, but why? ♪

00:17:20.058 --> 00:17:23.291
♪ Who tipped the balance
of this season? ♪

00:17:23.781 --> 00:17:26.964
♪ Is the crushing blow necessary ♪

00:17:26.965 --> 00:17:28.559
♪ For one to rise up and see? ♪

00:17:28.586 --> 00:17:31.226
♪ Fight on in this uphill battle ♪

00:17:31.227 --> 00:17:33.504
♪ Face the reality ♪

00:17:33.525 --> 00:17:36.218
♪ Setting foot in this forbidden city ♪

00:17:36.245 --> 00:17:39.550
♪ Breaking the rules that silence me ♪

00:17:40.288 --> 00:17:41.599
♪ The more I go against it ♪

00:17:41.643 --> 00:17:43.032
♪ The more certain I am ♪

00:17:43.033 --> 00:17:45.147
♪ As I follow my heart ♪

00:17:45.871 --> 00:17:47.041
♪ The wind blows ♪

00:17:47.042 --> 00:17:49.317
♪ I am soaring into the sky ♪

00:17:49.318 --> 00:17:50.250
♪ As we meet ♪

00:17:50.251 --> 00:17:52.356
♪ One time you fight the fear ♪

00:17:52.357 --> 00:17:53.857
♪ Fly to high ♪

00:17:53.893 --> 00:17:57.356
♪ Every drop of sweat remembers
how you have tried ♪

00:17:57.399 --> 00:17:59.150
♪ You are born to be the one ♪

00:17:59.151 --> 00:18:01.071
♪ Who realize all desires ♪

00:18:01.072 --> 00:18:03.252
♪ Until we start to fight ♪

00:18:03.273 --> 00:18:04.577
♪ Keep alive ♪

00:18:04.578 --> 00:18:07.925
♪ No matter what they said
you must believe in yourself ♪

00:18:07.926 --> 00:18:10.855
♪ You will breaking through the night ♪

00:18:10.856 --> 00:18:14.322
♪ Fire in your eyes shining so bright ♪

00:18:14.858 --> 00:18:15.957
♪ Oh ♪

00:18:16.584 --> 00:18:20.226
♪ You're always standing by my side ♪
